==Route 132==
[[File:Hoenn Route 132 RSE.png|thumb|Route 132]]

Located in the south-central part of [[Hoenn]]'s ocean, {{rt|132|Hoenn}} leads west from [[Pacifidlog Town]] to {{rt|133|Hoenn}}. The route is dominated by a {{DL|Water tile|Currents|rapid, westward-flowing current}} that prohibits any controlled movement while {{m|Surf}}ing. Ancient ruins are rumored to lie submerged nearby, but reaching them will require careful planning to reach them.

