===Northern path, Part 1===
Follow the central currents to the calm waters in the middle of the route. Continue westward to reach the patch of shallow water in the northwest, and collect the [[Rare Candy]] from its northern half. Surf westward from here to pass through the northeast shallows on {{rt|133|Hoenn}}.

===Central path, Part 1===
Ride the southernmost currents to the southeast island. Jump into the current off the north side of the island to reach the shallow waters in the northwest. Sail westward from here to reach the southernmost of the northeast shallows on {{rt|133|Hoenn}}.

===Down to the Depths, Part 1===
Ride the southernmost currents to the southeast island. Continue westward to reach a patch of calm water surrounded by shallows. Sail westward again to be whisked past a circular patch of deep water on the way to {{rt|133|Hoenn}}.

