===Northern path, Part 2===
After passing between the northeastern shallows, you come to rest in the calm waters in the northwest part of {{rt|133|Hoenn}}. Collect the [[Star Piece]] from the north side of the nearby rock outcropping. Surf westward again to reach the calm waters on the north side of {{rt|134|Hoenn}}.

===Central path, Part 2===
Pick up the [[Big Pearl]] from the southernmost of the northeast shallows. Continue westward to reach the south side of the northwest island. Sail westward again to reach {{rt|134|Hoenn}}.

===Down to the Depths, Part 2===
Sail westward from the calm waters to reach the south-central patch of shallow water. Go west again to the patch of shallow water that borders {{rt|134|Hoenn}}.
