===Northern path, Part 3===
From the calm waters in the north, sail westward again to reach the western-most point of the long, narrow sandbar. Continue westward to the calm waters outside [[Slateport City]].

===Central path, Part 3===
From the shallow water to the east of the narrow sandbar, follow the current to the patch of shallow water in the northwest, and the calm waters outside [[Slateport City]] beyond.

===Down to the Depths, Part 3===
Sail westward from the middle of the shallow water to reach a circular spot of deep water surrounded by a ring of six stones. Use {{m|Dive}} to find an underwater cave, then swim southward through a long trench to a large rock. Examine the south side of the rock to find a [[Braille]] inscription.

